{
    "title": "Charades & Headbands: Guess Up",
    "description": "\"Charades & Headbands: Guess Up\" is an amazing word guessing game for parties in the form of reverse charades. \r\n\r\nGuess Up brings a fun twist on all-time family favorites like charades, catchphrase, hot hands, and the classic headbands \u2018who is who\u2019 game. A fun choice for an entertaining charades game night with friends or family.\r\n\r\nYou can play \"Charades & Headbands: Guess Up\" at home with your family, when you're out with friends, or even while you're waiting in line!\r\n \r\nHow do you play Guess Up? There is nothing easier! \r\nIn the style of reverse charades, <b>simply place the phone on your forehead</b> and guess the word on the card by listening and watching your friends mimic and act the word out.\u00a0They can also describe the word, or shout out clues for you to guess the word, just like in your typical charades party game. There are also several categories for you to sing, dance, and make sounds or impressions, such as Act it Out, Animals, Food, Animation Movies, Superheroes, Brands, and much more!\r\n\r\n<b> FEATURES: </b>\r\n\r\n\u25c6 \"Charades & Headbands: Guess Up\" is available in 25 languages.\r\n\u25c6 Choose a deck, place the phone on your forehead and start guessing.\r\n\u25c6 Challenge your friends and family for a night of charades with Team Mode!\r\n\u25c6 Record your gameplay, and save it on your phone to watch later. \r\n\u25c6 Create your own categories, and share them with friends to play custom charades.\r\n\u25c6 Purchase curated packs with your favorite decks.\r\n\u25c6 Guess the most words you can before time runs out!\r\n\u25c6 Join our VIP Subscription plans to unlock ALL content, remove ads, and much more\u2026!\r\n\r\n\"Charades & Headbands: Guess Up\" is guaranteed to make Saturday game night with your friends and family even more fun. Choose a deck, place the phone on your forehead, let your friends act it out, guess the word, and have fun. You will have the time of your life playing this fun charades acting game! \r\n\r\n=======\r\n\r\nAny questions or suggestions? Reach us at guessup@cosmicode.pt\r\n\r\nBe a part of our community!\r\nFace\u00adbook - face\u00adbook.\u00adcom/gues\u00adsup\r\nIn\u00adsta\u00adgram - in\u00adsta\u00adgram.\u00adcom/gues\u00adsu\u00adpapp/\r\n\r\n=======\r\n\r\n<b>Have fun playing \"Charades & Headbands: Guess Up\" at your next game night!</b>\r\n\r\n=======\r\n\r\nTerms of Use: https://cosmicode.games/terms",
    "descriptionHTML": "&quot;Charades &amp; Headbands: Guess Up&quot; is an amazing word guessing game for parties in the form of reverse charades. <br><br>Guess Up brings a fun twist on all-time family favorites like charades, catchphrase, hot hands, and the classic headbands \u2018who is who\u2019 game. A fun choice for an entertaining charades game night with friends or family.<br><br>You can play &quot;Charades &amp; Headbands: Guess Up&quot; at home with your family, when you&#39;re out with friends, or even while you&#39;re waiting in line!<br> <br>How do you play Guess Up? There is nothing easier! <br>In the style of reverse charades, <b>simply place the phone on your forehead</b> and guess the word on the card by listening and watching your friends mimic and act the word out.\u00a0They can also describe the word, or shout out clues for you to guess the word, just like in your typical charades party game. There are also several categories for you to sing, dance, and make sounds or impressions, such as Act it Out, Animals, Food, Animation Movies, Superheroes, Brands, and much more!<br><br><b> FEATURES: </b><br><br>\u25c6 &quot;Charades &amp; Headbands: Guess Up&quot; is available in 25 languages.<br>\u25c6 Choose a deck, place the phone on your forehead and start guessing.<br>\u25c6 Challenge your friends and family for a night of charades with Team Mode!<br>\u25c6 Record your gameplay, and save it on your phone to watch later. <br>\u25c6 Create your own categories, and share them with friends to play custom charades.<br>\u25c6 Purchase curated packs with your favorite decks.<br>\u25c6 Guess the most words you can before time runs out!<br>\u25c6 Join our VIP Subscription plans to unlock ALL content, remove ads, and much more\u2026!<br><br>&quot;Charades &amp; Headbands: Guess Up&quot; is guaranteed to make Saturday game night with your friends and family even more fun. Choose a deck, place the phone on your forehead, let your friends act it out, guess the word, and have fun. You will have the time of your life playing this fun charades acting game! <br><br>=======<br><br>Any questions or suggestions? Reach us at guessup@cosmicode.pt<br><br>Be a part of our community!<br>Face\u00adbook - face\u00adbook.\u00adcom/gues\u00adsup<br>In\u00adsta\u00adgram - in\u00adsta\u00adgram.\u00adcom/gues\u00adsu\u00adpapp/<br><br>=======<br><br><b>Have fun playing &quot;Charades &amp; Headbands: Guess Up&quot; at your next game night!</b><br><br>=======<br><br>Terms of Use: https://cosmicode.games/terms",
